nce shareholder value through a combination with us, thereby offering attractive risk-adjusted returns for our shareholders;","context":"•","section":"Business Combination Criteria","block":249,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001193125-25-308177","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2025-12-04","reportDate":"2025-09-30","cik":"0002044009","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2044009/000119312525308177/d66244d10k.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/aedfca0eed46e89f9220e1d71ede7fbbc9ce238681268a6b14f48c2593a4ed70.bin","sha256":"aedfca0eed46e89f9220e1d71ede7fbbc9ce238681268a6b14f48c2593a4ed70"}},{"id":"dc1e52df55cddf7dc01131e6fe8602574d62678cbcea6bcde7d83d50f1abe649","quote":"Is at an inflection point, such as requiring additional management expertise, and able to accelerate growth and financial performance through differentiated business models and the addition of our operational, financial, transactional and legal expertise and networks;","context":"•","section":"Business Combination Criteria","block":251,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001193125-25-308177","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2025-12-04","reportDate":"2025-09-30","cik":"0002044009","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2044009/000119312525308177/d66244d10k.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/aedfca0eed46e89f9220e1d71ede7fbbc9ce238681268a6b14f48c2593a4ed70.bin","sha256":"aedfca0eed46e89f9220e1d71ede7fbbc9ce238681268a6b14f48c2593a4ed70"}},{"id":"609df10d400e0a8ccb39c19e09109fc36440deaf3d6ca121c0529adb038c318a","quote":"Is in need of a flexible, creative or opportunistic structure where we can deliver additional value;","context":"•","section":"Business Combination Criteria","block":253,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001193125-25-30817